ity was unavailable.After undergoing other tests, he was subsequently shifted back to Adiala Jail without the CTA, which can help detect coronary blockages and assess the risk of a heart attack. Prime Minister Shehbaz Sharif alsotook noticeof the non-functional CTA facility at Pims and constituted an inquiry committee to determine the facts.Sources had earlier toldDawnthat the Cardiac Centre’s conventional angiography facility at Pims was different from a CTA. While conventional angiography involved inserting a...", "published_at": "2026-08-25 09:36:56+00", "image_url": "https://i.dawn.com/large/2026/08/2514112958e9a02.webp", "source": {"name": "Dawn", "tier": "international", "url": "https://www.dawn.com"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 50, "sensationalism": 9, "opinion_fact": 7, "factual_rigor": 71, "framing": 13, "confidence": 0.66, "rationale": "\"{\\\"lean\\\": {\\\"keyword_score\\\": 50.0, \\\"framing_shift\\\": 0.0, \\\"entity_shift\\\": 0.0, \\\"sentence_direction\\\": 0.0, \\\"text_score\\\": 50.0, \\\"source_baseline\\\": 50, \\\"text_shift\\\": 0.0, \\\"delta_max\\\": 24, \\\"confidence\\\": 1.0, \\\"top_left_keywords\\\": [], \\\"top_right_keywords\\\": [], \\\"framing_phrases_found\\\": [], \\\"entity_sentiments\\\": {}, \\\"state_affiliated\\\": false, \\\"unscored\\\": true}, \\\"sensationalism\\\": {\\\"headline_score\\\": 1.6, \\\"body_score\\\": 6.6, \\\"clickbait_signals\\\": 0, \\\"superlative_density\\\": 0.0, \\\"urgency_density\\\": 0.0, \\\"hyperbole_density\\\": 0.0, \\\"measured_density\\\": 0.0, \\\"partisan_attack_density\\\": 0.0}, \\\"opinion\\\": {\\\"pronoun_score\\\": 4.9, \\\"subjectivity_score\\\": 22.0, \\\"modal_score\\\": 7.8, \\\"hedging_score\\\": 0.0, \\\"attribution_score\\\": 6.0, \\\"metadata_score\\\": 0.0, \\\"value_judgment_score\\\": 0.0, \\\"absolutist_assertion_score\\\": 0.0, \\\"classification\\\": \\\"Reporting\\\", \\\"dominant_signals\\\": [\\\"subjectivity\\\", \\\"modal_language\\\", \\\"attribution_gaps\